    "CSV 格式与限制" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CSV Format & Limitations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CSV 用于普通流水交换，不是完整备份；标签、附件和自动化来源不会保留，余额校准及报销/退款到账会被跳过并明确报告。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CSV is for exchanging regular transactions, not for full backups. Tags, attachments, and automation source metadata are not preserved. Balance calibrations and reimbursement/refund settlements are skipped and reported."
          }
        }
      }
    },
